{"mls":"R1708163","addr":"105 Matteson Street","muni":"Fredonia village","town":"Pomfret","county":"Chautauqua","zip":"14063","ll":[42.450291,-79.352228],"status":"Active","type":"Single Family","units":1,"beds":4,"baths":2,"sqft":2044.0,"year":1851,"lot":6.1,"dom":45,"price":374900,"orig":399900,"chg":"Price Change","tax":8122,"tax_mls":true,"hoa":null,"office":"Howard Hanna Holt - Fredonia","phone":"716-673-5186","hhp":false,"remarks":"Canadaway Creek Country Retreat! Village of Fredonia, Charming 4-bedroom, 2-full-bath Colonial, built in the 1850s and beautifully situated on over 6 acres bordering Canadaway Creek! This picturesque property offers a rare combination of historic character, natural beauty and thoughtful updates. Trails wind through the property and lead to the creek, creating a truly special outdoor setting.\r\n\r\nAn enclosed side porch welcomes you into the bright and cheerful kitchen. Inside, you’ll find a welcoming front parlor, formal dining room and spacious living room featuring a cozy woodburning fireplace. A convenient first-floor laundry closet includes a stackable washer and dryer. Some newer windows throughout add to the home’s appeal.\r\n\r\nOutdoor living is exceptional with a fenced-in-ground pool, complete with a 2014 liner, 2008 heater and 2020 pump. The amazing two-story barn offers tremendous character and versatility, along with a covered side deck. Additional conveniences include an outdoor RV hookup and generator hookup.\r\n\r\nMajor updates include a 2026 boiler, 2024 roof and 2025 sump pump with gravity-fed backup pump. Meticulously maintained by the same seller for over 50 years, this is a truly special property offering privacy, acreage, history and direct access to the natural beauty of Canadaway Creek!","facts":[["Total rooms","10"],["Full baths","2"],["Half baths","0"],["Style","Colonial, Two Story"],["Levels","Two"],["Stories","2"],["Building area (sq ft)","2,044"],["Heating","Gas, Baseboard, Hot Water"],["Basement","Cr